version: 2.0.0
description: |
  Integration tests for paradigm-mcp — covers schema-mutating tools (portal/purpose writers) with write-verify assertions. First tests/ file added in v5.37.11 as regression protection for the silent-no-op bug class.
components:
  portal-writer-tests:
    description: Regression suite for addGateToPortal/addRouteToPortal covering Array→{} normalization, read-back verification, and silent-no-op protection on v2 scaffold shapes
    type: test
    anchors:
      - portal-writer.test.ts:1-400
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - portal
  yaml-validator-tests:
    description: Regression suite for safeLoad — missing / unparseable / invalid / ok discriminated union; SECURITY assertion that unparseable detail does NOT contain raw file contents, gate names, or route paths. Added v5.37.12.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - yaml-validator.test.ts:1-200
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - security
      - fail-closed
  pack-loader-tests:
    description: Regression suite for v6.0 pack-loader — loadPackManifest / discoverPacks (3 sources + precedence + parentPackId wiring + cache invalidation) / resolveEntryAddress (bare vs prefixed form + ambiguity errors). SECURITY assertion that thrown errors NEVER leak manifest content or plant-sentinel strings. Added v5.39.0 sub-phase 3.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - pack-loader.test.ts:1-400
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - security
      - university
  university-multi-tenant-tests:
    description: Integration suite for multi-tenant University — project pack + discipline sub-pack CRUD, pack-id stamping, cross-pack address resolution, v5-layout fallback via loadOrFabricatePackManifest. Added v5.39.0 sub-phase 3.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - university-multi-tenant.test.ts:1-320
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - university
  decision-migration-tests:
    description: Regression suite for v6.0 decision-store migration — wisdom-decisions → TD-streams, lore type=decision rewriting to type=insight with references.decision_id, idempotency on re-run, companion-lore for recordDecision (D3). Added v5.39.0 sub-phase 3.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - decision-migration.test.ts:1-260
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - streams
  university-metrics-tests:
    description: Regression suite for v6.0 university-metrics — captureSnapshot shape + same-day idempotence + local_snapshots_enabled gate, pruneOldSnapshots 90-day retention, computeProjectSaltHash stability. SECURITY assertion that planted gate-name / route / title sentinels NEVER appear in serialized snapshot JSON (D7 privacy contract). Added v5.39.0 sub-phase 3.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - university-metrics.test.ts:1-240
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - security
      - university
      - privacy
